    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">This organic coffee from Guatemala comes from our friends at OPTCO (Organic Products Trading Company). It is part of their Cafe Feminino project that promotes equity for women producers in farming communities. A well balanced coffee that goes well in many applications, its classic enough for anyone to enjoy but has enough acidity and pop to keep you excited to wake up.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Tasting Notes: Almond, Citrus, Cocoa</span></p>",
